    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Meta Ads for D2C brands in Thane cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We work in three tiers for most D2C brands: Starter from Rs 1 Lakh / month retainer, Growth from Rs 1.5-3 Lakh / month, and Enterprise above Rs 3 Lakh / month. Ad spend is pass-through, billed by you directly on platforms. Full tier pricing is published on our pricing page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long before we see results from Meta Ads in Thane?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For D2C brands, meaningful signal usually arrives in weeks 3-6: lower CPL, higher ROAS, better conversion. Compounding - subscription attach, repeat rate, organic lift - shows at month 3-6. We publish a 90-day plan on day one so expectations are clear."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a realistic ROAS target for a D2C brand in Thane?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For D2C brands in Thane, we target blended ROAS in the range typical for the category and AOV (Rs 500 to Rs 10,000+): what matters more is LTV / CAC, repeat rate and payback period. We rebuild attribution first so we are optimising against real economics, not platform-reported numbers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you only run Meta Ads (Facebook + Instagram), or do you handle the full funnel for D2C brands?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We handle the full funnel. For D2C brands that includes creative, Shopify / website, WhatsApp CRM, SEO, retention flows and reporting. Meta Ads is the acquisition layer; without the funnel underneath, scaled spend wastes money."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you work with a D2C brand that is just launching in Thane?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Pre-launch is a strong moment for D2C brands because we help with brand positioning, Shopify / app build, launch creative, first retention loops and the first-paid-spend playbook. We take pre-funding and stealth-launch clients across D2C and B2B."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which channels do you prioritise for D2C brands in Thane?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For D2C brands in Thane: Meta (Instagram + Facebook), Google Search + PMax, Instagram organic + Reels, WhatsApp Cloud API, Quick commerce (Zepto / Blinkit / Instamart) where SKU-fit. Secondary channels include Pinterest, YouTube review ecosystem, Nykaa / Amazon / Flipkart ad spend. The specific mix depends on your AOV, repeat rate, and category maturity."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you handle creative for D2C brands, or do we need a separate creative agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We handle creative in-house. For D2C brands that means UGC + creator velocity, Concern + outcome-led hooks, Founder + brand-story content, and more. Creative velocity is often the single biggest CPL lever in the first 6 months."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you measure success for Meta Ads campaigns?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We measure what matters for D2C brands: Blended ROAS + MER, Subscription attach rate, Repeat rate + cohort LTV, Creative velocity + ad units shipped per month. Platform-reported ROAS is one input, not the headline number. CRM + CAPI + Enhanced Conversions give us the real view."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you provide dedicated account management for D2C brands in Thane?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every account has a dedicated performance lead, creative producer and strategist. On Growth and Enterprise tiers, you get a full pod (strategy + performance + creative + CRM + reporting). Weekly syncs and monthly QBRs are standard."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you share named references of other D2C brands you have worked with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, under NDA on a discovery call. Most of our D2C brands clients prefer confidentiality while they scale. We can connect you directly with past clients to ask about delivery, attribution honesty and team quality."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes Meta Ads for D2C brands different from a traditional agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We are a tech + marketing studio. We rebuild attribution, write production code, run performance ads, build the WhatsApp CRM and ship the mobile app - often inside the same engagement. Agencies hand you a deck; we hand you a working system."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you handle lead qualification and sales follow-up for D2C brands?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We build the lead-capture + routing + CRM + call-centre scripts + follow-up SLAs. Actual sales calls are handled by your team or a partner you choose. We instrument the handoff so you see conversion at every stage of the funnel."}}]}</script>
