            <h2>How we run Meta Ads for D2C brands in Thane</h2>
            <p>Our Meta Ads approach for D2C brands starts with attribution. Before we touch spend, we rebuild tracking so platform-reported ROAS stops lying - CRM + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + offline conversion imports where relevant. Then we build the channel architecture: Meta (Instagram + Facebook), Google Search + PMax, Instagram organic + Reels, WhatsApp Cloud API, Quick commerce (Zepto / Blinkit / Instamart) where SKU-fit as primary, with Pinterest, YouTube review ecosystem, Nykaa / Amazon / Flipkart ad spend layered in as the account matures. Creative strategy is the next lever. For D2C brands the angles that consistently work are: UGC + creator velocity, Concern + outcome-led hooks, Founder + brand-story content, Subscription + bundling. We ship 20-30 creative units a month in the first 6 months because creative velocity is the single biggest CPL lever early in an engagement.</p>

            <h3>Channels we prioritise</h3>
            <div class="pm-channel-grid">
                <div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">01</span><div><strong>Meta (Instagram + Facebook)</strong><p>Discovery, retargeting, Click-to-WhatsApp, Advantage+ Shopping, Lookalike audiences.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">02</span><div><strong>Google Search + PMax</strong><p>Channel-specific campaigns, creative, audiences, and reporting.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">03</span><div><strong>Instagram organic + Reels</strong><p>Trust-build + brand velocity + creator UGC + ad-ready content.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">04</span><div><strong>WhatsApp Cloud API</strong><p>Automation + routing + lifecycle flows for retention and re-engagement.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">05</span><div><strong>Quick commerce (Zepto / Blinkit / Instamart) where SKU-fit</strong><p>Instant-gratification channel for high-trial consumables.</p></div></div>
            </div>
